Package: kosh
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Deepak Vamsi <deepakvamsi@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: 30000
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/deepakvamsi/kosh
Description: Kosh — local-only encrypted API key manager
 A strictly local, offline desktop application for managing developer secrets,
 API keys, and passwords. No cloud backend, no network calls, no AI-tool access.
 Encrypted with Argon2id + XChaCha20-Poly1305. Built with Go + Wails.
